Brothers

In 2015 your lodge purchased a brick for the Scottish Rite Cathedral 
fund raising program.The program went dormant. IIl Bro Randy Jager, 
Deputy to the Supreme Council, wants it to be completed. I have accepted 
that responsibility.

The bricks are now tile and will be displayed in the cathedral dining 
room.Unfortunately all engraving information has been lost.

You have one 8 inch tile = 1 LOGO plus 5 lines of engraving at 20 spaces 
each.

There is no cost to you.

Please help me complete this project and complete the attached order form.

Fraternally,

III Bro Bob Meisenheimer

I can be reached at:

520-229-9294 (home w/ voice mail)

520-403-0535(cell)


