    </p>
    <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%">Brothers</span></p>
    <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%">In
        2015 your
        lodge purchased a brick for the Scottish Rite Cathedral fund
        raising program.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span>The
        program went dormant. IIl Bro Randy
        Jager, Deputy to the Supreme Council, wants it to be completed.
        I have accepted
        that responsibility.</span></p>
    <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%">The
        bricks
        are now tile and will be displayed in the cathedral dining room.<span
          style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span>Unfortunately all engraving
        information has
        been lost.</span></p>
    <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%">You
        have one
        8 inch tile = 1 LOGO plus 5 lines of engraving at 20 spaces
        each. </span></p>
    <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%">There
        is no
        cost to you.</span></p>
    <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%">Please
        help
        me complete this project and complete the attached order form.</span></p>
    <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%">Fraternally,</span></p>
    <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%">III
        Bro Bob
        Meisenheimer</span></p>
    <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%">I
        can be
        reached at:</span></p>
    <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%">520-229-9294
        <span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> </span>(home w/ voice mail)</span></p>
    <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%">520-403-0535<span
          style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span>(cell)</span></p>
    <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:115%"> </span></p>
    <p><br>
    </p>
